# Design Assets Enforcement

**Trigger**: Always active — enforce whenever modifying or creating UI components.

## Core Rule

All UI components must use **shadcn/ui** components. Never use raw HTML elements where a semantically appropriate shadcn component exists. Prefer composition over hand-rolling accessible components.

## Component Mapping

Use these shadcn components instead of plain HTML elements:

| UI Element | Use | Instead Of |
|-----------|-----|-----------|
| Button | `<Button />` from `@/components/ui/button` | Plain `<button>` without shadcn styling |
| Card | `<Card />` from `@/components/ui/card` | `<div>` with shadow styles |
| Input | `<Input />` from `@/components/ui/input` | `<input>` with raw styling |
| Label | `<Label />` from `@/components/ui/label` | `<label>` with manual styling |
| Badge | `<Badge />` from `@/components/ui/badge` | `<span>` with colored bg |
| Text | Semantic HTML (`<p>`, `<h1>`–`<h6>`, `<span>`) with className | Plain `<div>` with text styles |
| Dialog/Modal | `@/components/ui/dialog` | Hand-rolled modal |
| Toast | `@/components/ui/sonner` or `@/components/ui/toast` | Custom toast |
| Select | `<Select />` from `@/components/ui/select` | Native `<select>` |
| Switch | `<Switch />` from `@/components/ui/switch` | Plain checkbox |
| Separator | `<Separator />` from `@/components/ui/separator` | `<hr>` with manual styling |
| Avatar | `<Avatar />` from `@/components/ui/avatar` | `<img>` with circle |
| Tabs | `<Tabs />` from `@/components/ui/tabs` | Manual tab state |
| Tooltip | `<Tooltip />` from `@/components/ui/tooltip` | Custom tooltip |
| Dropdown Menu | `<DropdownMenu />` from `@/components/ui/dropdown-menu` | Custom popover |
| Progress | `<Progress />` from `@/components/ui/progress` | `<div>` with width |
| Skeleton | `<Skeleton />` from `@/components/ui/skeleton` | `<div>` with gray bg |
| Accordion | `<Accordion />` from `@/components/ui/accordion` | Manual expand/collapse |

## Styling Rules

### 1. Use Tailwind Classes via className

```tsx
// GOOD
<div className="flex min-h-screen bg-background p-4">
  <h2 className="text-foreground text-lg font-semibold">Title</h2>
</div>

// BAD — raw inline styles
<div style={{ minHeight: '100vh', backgroundColor: '#fff', padding: '16px' }}>
  <h2 style={{ color: '#000', fontSize: '18px', fontWeight: '600' }}>Title</h2>
</div>
```

### 2. Use the `cn()` utility for Conditional Classes

```tsx
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";

<div className={cn(
  "rounded-lg border",
  isActive && "border-primary bg-primary/5",
  className
)} />
```

### 3. Colors Come from CSS Variables (Tokens)

All colors use CSS variables defined in `src/app/globals.css`. Never hardcode hex/rgb colors.

#### Base Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-background` | `--background` | Page/canvas background |
| `text-foreground` | `--foreground` | Primary text color |
| `bg-card` | `--card` | Card backgrounds |
| `bg-primary` | `--primary` | Primary actions |
| `bg-secondary` | `--secondary` | Secondary elements |
| `bg-muted` | `--muted` | De-emphasized content |
| `bg-accent` | `--accent` | Hover/active states |
| `bg-destructive` | `--destructive` | Error/danger states |
| `border-border` | `--border` | Borders |
| `ring-ring` | `--ring` | Focus rings |

#### Brand Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-brand` / `bg-brand-500` | `--brand` | Primary brand accent, CTAs |
| `bg-brand-soft` | `--brand-soft` | Soft accent for subtle highlights |

#### Semantic Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-success` | `--success` | Success states |
| `bg-warning` | `--warning` | Warnings |
| `bg-info` | `--info` | Info notifications |

#### Chart Colors

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-chart-c1` to `bg-chart-c10` | `--chart-1` to `--chart-10` | Analytics/data visualization colors |

#### AI Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-ai-surface` | `--ai-surface` | AI agent surface background |
| `bg-ai-confidence-high` | `--ai-confidence-high` | High confidence badge |
| `bg-ai-confidence-medium` | `--ai-confidence-medium` | Medium confidence badge |
| `bg-ai-confidence-low` | `--ai-confidence-low` | Low confidence badge |

### 4. Use Semantic Tailwind Classes

```tsx
// GOOD — semantic tokens
className="bg-card text-card-foreground rounded-lg border-border"

// BAD — hardcoded colors
className="bg-white text-black rounded-lg border-gray-200"
```

### 5. Border Radius Tokens

```
rounded-sm = calc(var(--radius) * 0.6)
rounded-md = calc(var(--radius) * 0.8)
rounded-lg = var(--radius)
rounded-xl = calc(var(--radius) * 1.4)
rounded-2xl = calc(var(--radius) * 1.8)
rounded-3xl = calc(var(--radius) * 2.2)
rounded-4xl = calc(var(--radius) * 2.6)
```

### 6. Spacing Uses Tailwind Scale

Use Tailwind spacing (`p-4`, `gap-2`, `m-6`) — never pixel values. The scale is 0.25rem (4px) based.

## Component Location

All UI components live in:

```
@/components/ui/
  ├── button.tsx
  ├── card.tsx
  ├── input.tsx
  ├── badge.tsx
  ├── separator.tsx
  └── ... (add via CLI)
```

Add new components using:

```powershell
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component-name>
```

## Portals

Modal-like components (Dialog, DropdownMenu, Tooltip, Popover) render through Radix Portals automatically. No manual portal host setup is needed.

## Dark Mode

Dark mode is automatic via CSS `.dark` class variables in `src/app/globals.css`. Components using semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`) adapt automatically. Do not manually detect or switch dark mode in components.

## Accessibility

- Touch/click targets: minimum `min-h-10` (40px) height
- Use `aria-label` on icon-only buttons
- Status indicators: always combine color + icon + text (never color alone)
- Focus rings: provided by Radix/shadcn — do not remove

## What to Check Before Committing UI Changes

- [ ] No hardcoded color values (hex, rgb, rgba) — use token classes
- [ ] No plain `<button>` where `<Button />` applies
- [ ] No inline `style={{}}` where `className` with Tailwind applies
- [ ] New UI components added via `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add`, not hand-written
- [ ] `cn()` used for conditional class merging
- [ ] Touch/click targets meet 40px minimum
- [ ] Status tokens used correctly (success/warning/info) — no ad-hoc colors
- [ ] Chart colors use `chart.c1`-`c10` only — no custom palettes
- [ ] AI surfaces use `ai-surface` tokens — no hardcoded blues
